<title>HUNGARY: Skala-Coop to enter Frankfurt OTC-market.</title>
<headline>Skala-Coop to enter Frankfurt OTC-market.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange (BSE) has given its permission for holding company Skala-Coop Rt to introduce its &quot;T&quot; series registered shares on the over-the-counter (OTC) market of the Frankfurt Securities Exchange, the BSE said in its official gazette on Monday.</p>
<p>The shares are currently traded in the BSE's listed &quot;B&quot; category.</p>
<p>Skala-Coop &quot;T&quot; shares closed at 2,100 forints on the BSE on December 31.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
